<para id="RM0000008Y100ZX" category="C" type-id="3007P" name-id="066O0-00" from="200708">
<dtccode>P0500/42</dtccode>
<dtcname>Vehicle Speed Sensor System</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM0000008Y100ZX_01" type-id="31" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000D8F00000">
<name>Circuit Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<ptxt>The vehicle speed pulse signal output from the ABS speed sensor installed on each wheel is converted by the skid control computer into a vehicle speed pulse signal (equivalent to 4 pulses per 1 revolution of the transaxle rotating shaft), output to the combination meter assembly as the vehicle speed signal, and input to the engine control computer.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="A065387J10" width="7.106578999in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
